# Root build context is used only by the voice-gw image (S14), which needs both
# `backend/` (the in-process IntakeEngine) and `voice-gw/`. Keep the context lean
# — the api/web/backend images use their own sub-directory contexts and are
# unaffected by this file.
.git
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
**/.pytest_cache/
**/.ruff_cache/
**/.venv/
web/node_modules/
web/.next/
web/test-results/
web/playwright-report/
**/.mypy_cache/
*.log
